(def vec-page "(module prelude/vec)\n\nBuilds, reads and reorders vectors.\n\n(at items index)\n    Returns a borrow of the item at an index.\n(collect items)\n    Collects the items of an iterator into a vector.\n(copied items)\n    Returns an iterator over copies of a slice's items.\n(dedup! items)\n    Removes from a vector each item equal to the one before it.\n(first items)\n    Returns a borrow of a slice's first item as an `option`.\n(iter collection)\n    Returns an iterator over borrows of a collection's items.\n(last items)\n    Returns a borrow of a slice's last item as an `option`.\n(pop! items)\n    Removes a vector's last item and returns it as an `option`.\n(push! target item)\n    Adds an item to a vector or a string.\n(remove-at! items index)\n    Removes the item at an index and returns it.\n(reverse items)\n    Returns an iterator over borrows of a slice's items, last item first.\n(reverse! items)\n    Reverses a vector in place.\n(sort! items)\n    Sorts a vector in place, in ascending order.\n(sort-by! items key)\n    Sorts a vector in place by the key of each item.\n(defmacro vec (elements ...))\n    Builds a vector from its elements, which all have one type.\n(windows items size)\n    Returns an iterator over each run of `size` neighboring items of a slice.")
